The Xorns can be contained throughout the process, and by the time
you're done guillotining you can generally take them out easily.
Wands of striking aren't a problem (you don't stand in the line of
fire--that's standard practice, and the reason that this is a safe way
to take out the soldier w/ the wand of death).  Master/arch liches are
a real problem, make sure you check for them from the upstairs. The
minotaur that's sometimes in the maze is also a problem (you can often
use the ?earth from sokoban to contain him).  And if you're low hp,
you can be one-hit by a shark as you walk into position to write
Elbereth, so you need to be careful about that.

But in general it's doable as long as you excersize a little care.



